<!--
   Backup and device-transfer rules for Android 12+. Android's defaults apply: memos, settings and wake-phrase samples
   can be part of the user's cloud backup and device-to-device transfer. The speech model lives in noBackupFilesDir,
   which is never backed up. Disclosed in README.md ("Privacy").
-->
<data-extraction-rules>
    <cloud-backup />
</data-extraction-rules>
